{
  "$comment": "VAPP-241 (eApps P1, docs/package-format.md \"Public links\"): a package's `share`, validated by the TS reference (src/host/share.ts validatePackageShares) and the Rust core (host::share::validate_package_shares). Each case = `share` over the `package` below, `issues` = what validatePackage adds. VAPP-246: a view link's `template` renders over the snapshot, so install refuses one a guest's host could not run: only `records:<kind>` (at most `?query=<the link's query>`) reads, no RecordForm, RecordTable `editable: false`, no call but `set` and `openUrl`, no listed extension component, no `exp:` string, and its expressions must check over the narrowed row with no query. The links themselves (tokens, caps, the guest pages) = packages/domain-contract/fixtures/app-share.json.",
